257
00:18:41,067 --> 00:18:42,067
We know you kidnapped all those poor mermaids from the beach in the south!

258
00:18:42,067 --> 00:18:43,067
Where did you take them, huh?

259
00:18:43,067 --> 00:18:44,067
You've got the wrong guys here.

260
00:18:44,067 --> 00:18:59,067
Besides, what gives you the idea that we're the ones behind this?

261
00:18:59,067 --> 00:19:00,067
I mean, I will admit it.

262
00:19:00,067 --> 00:19:01,067
But it's so good to you all.

263
00:19:01,067 --> 00:19:02,067
You're as bad.

264
00:19:02,067 --> 00:19:03,067
You're not a guy, are you?

265
00:19:03,067 --> 00:19:04,067
I'm not a guy, dude.

266
00:19:04,067 --> 00:19:06,067
You're not a guy-

267
00:19:06,067 --> 00:19:09,067
Everyone's behind this. I mean, I will admit...

268
00:19:09,067 --> 00:19:13,067
I love mermaids so much I want to keep them all for myself!

269
00:19:13,067 --> 00:19:17,067
Regardless, our crew didn't kidnap them.

270
00:19:17,067 --> 00:19:20,067
You hear that? He just admitted that he wants them!

271
00:19:20,067 --> 00:19:23,067
Will you jerks shut up? There's a dying man here!

272
00:19:23,067 --> 00:19:25,067
I knew you pirates were guilty!

273
00:19:25,067 --> 00:19:27,067
Get off our island!

274
00:19:31,067 --> 00:19:35,067
Hey, this bottle is almost full! That's a waste of good booze!

275
00:19:35,067 --> 00:19:36,067
Shut up, human!

276
00:19:36,067 --> 00:19:39,067
Oh, hey! Sanji! Chopper!

277
00:19:39,067 --> 00:19:42,067
Hey, Sanji! Get your nose under control!

278
00:19:42,067 --> 00:19:45,067
Luffy! Is that... a blowfish?

279
00:19:48,067 --> 00:19:50,067
Who is that human, gentlemen?

280
00:19:50,067 --> 00:19:54,067
And is that... a raccoon!

281
00:19:54,067 --> 00:19:56,067
It looks just like the picture I saw!

282
00:19:56,067 --> 00:19:59,067
You know them, Luffy? Your friends?

283
00:19:59,067 --> 00:20:02,067
Yeah. Those guys are my crew members.

284
00:20:02,067 --> 00:20:04,067
Wow, interesting crew.

285
00:20:04,067 --> 00:20:07,067
Look! Up there, the captain of the Straw Hat crew!

286
00:20:07,067 --> 00:20:08,067
You're right, it is!

287
00:20:08,067 --> 00:20:11,067
You gave the order to kidnap the mermaids, didn't you?

288
00:20:14,067 --> 00:20:17,067
We can't let all of the people down there see me!

289
00:20:17,067 --> 00:20:19,067
Hey! Shut your mouth! Hurry!

290
00:20:19,067 --> 00:20:22,067
I'm gonna go check things out on the ground!

291
00:20:22,067 --> 00:20:23,067
Huh?

292
00:20:23,067 --> 00:20:24,067
Huh?

293
00:20:24,067 --> 00:20:25,067
Huh?

294
00:20:25,067 --> 00:20:26,067
I'm gonna go check things out on the ground!

295
00:20:26,067 --> 00:20:27,067
Huh?

296
00:20:27,067 --> 00:20:28,067
Huh?

297
00:20:32,067 --> 00:20:33,067
He jumped off!

298
00:20:33,067 --> 00:20:36,067
Hey, Hachi! What happened?

299
00:20:36,067 --> 00:20:38,067
You... Leaf Straw Hat.

300
00:20:38,067 --> 00:20:42,067
Did some jerk do this to you? Tell me who it was!

301
00:20:42,067 --> 00:20:45,067
We tried, but he won't say for some reason!

302
00:20:45,067 --> 00:20:47,067
You have to get off the island!

303
00:20:47,067 --> 00:20:48,067
Ugh...

304
00:20:48,067 --> 00:20:50,067
That's the only thing he'll say.

305
00:20:51,067 --> 00:20:52,067
Hang on a second!

306
00:20:52,067 --> 00:20:55,067
I heard that Straw Hat had taken over the Ryugu Palace!

307
00:20:55,067 --> 00:20:56,067
It's a ploy!

308
00:20:56,067 --> 00:20:58,067
He's out to kidnap more of us mermaids!

309
00:20:58,067 --> 00:21:02,067
He left his men at the palace so he could go out marauding!

310
00:21:02,067 --> 00:21:04,067
I know what he wants!

311
00:21:04,067 --> 00:21:06,067
He's gonna kidnap Princess Shirahoshi, too!

312
00:21:06,067 --> 00:21:08,067
Oh, don't be ridiculous!

313
00:21:08,067 --> 00:21:10,067
That's absurd and you know it!

314
00:21:10,067 --> 00:21:12,067
The princess is the size of an orca!

315
00:21:12,067 --> 00:21:15,067
Plus, she's the god of the sea's only daughter, remember?

316
00:21:15,067 --> 00:21:18,067
Some lowlife might dream of kidnapping her,

317
00:21:18,067 --> 00:21:20,067
but nobody could pull it off!

318
00:21:20,067 --> 00:21:21,067
Huh?

319
00:21:21,067 --> 00:21:23,067
What's up with that blowfish?

320
00:21:29,067 --> 00:21:30,067
No!

321
00:21:32,067 --> 00:21:34,067
Aaxo!

322
00:21:34,067 --> 00:21:36,067
Ah!

323
00:21:52,067 --> 00:21:53,067
Augh!

324
00:21:57,067 --> 00:21:58,067
Hey!

325
00:21:58,067 --> 00:21:59,067
Oh, shit!

326
00:21:59,067 --> 00:22:01,067
Okay, stop this!

327
00:22:01,067 --> 00:22:03,067
Aaaaaaaaahhhhhhh!

328
00:22:21,067 --> 00:22:23,067
Princess Shira Hochi!

329
00:22:24,067 --> 00:22:25,067
I uh...

330
00:22:25,067 --> 00:22:26,067
Well um...

331
00:22:26,067 --> 00:22:27,067
You see...

332
00:22:27,067 --> 00:22:29,067
Uh...

333
00:22:29,067 --> 00:22:31,067
Good job! You found me!

334
00:22:31,067 --> 00:22:32,067
She's huge!

335
00:22:32,067 --> 00:22:33,067
Oh no!

336
00:22:33,067 --> 00:22:34,067
Is she...

337
00:22:34,067 --> 00:22:35,067
Oh!

338
00:22:35,067 --> 00:22:37,067
The Mermaid Princess!

339
00:22:37,067 --> 00:22:38,067
Hey, what's up?

340
00:22:38,067 --> 00:22:40,067
Something going on behind me?

341
00:22:40,067 --> 00:22:41,067
No, it's nothing!

342
00:22:41,067 --> 00:22:44,067
No matter what you hear, please don't turn around!

343
00:22:44,067 --> 00:22:46,067
Huh? Why? What's the big deal?

344
00:22:46,067 --> 00:22:47,067
Don't do it!

345
00:22:47,067 --> 00:22:50,067
I don't want you to die, Saji!

346
00:22:50,067 --> 00:22:52,067
Ah jeez...

347
00:22:52,067 --> 00:23:03,067
The pirates! They kidnapped the princess!

348
00:23:03,067 --> 00:23:04,067
Oh no!

349
00:23:08,067 --> 00:23:11,067
Luffy is captured by a group of stalwart fishermen

350
00:23:11,067 --> 00:23:14,067
who are enraged by Shira Hochi's apparent kidnapping.

351
00:23:14,067 --> 00:23:16,067
Suddenly, Van Der Decken appears,

352
00:23:16,067 --> 00:23:19,067
forcing Luffy into combat despite his arms being tied.

353
00:23:19,067 --> 00:23:21,067
If Luffy can escape to the sea forest,

354
00:23:21,067 --> 00:23:23,067
he will be reunited with Saji,

355
00:23:23,067 --> 00:23:27,067
but the lecherous shaft may not survive the sight of the Mermaid Princess.

356
00:23:27,067 --> 00:23:29,067
On the next, One Piece,

357
00:23:29,067 --> 00:23:31,067
keep Shira Hochi safe!

358
00:23:31,067 --> 00:23:33,067
Deck it close behind!

359
00:23:33,067 --> 00:23:35,067
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

